#
# Force LF on files that get executed or parsed inside Linux containers, regardless of the
# checkout platform's line-ending settings. A CRLF shebang line (`#!/bin/sh\r`) crash-loops a
# container with "no such file or directory" — a real bug hit and fixed in a sibling project;
# guarding against it here from day 1 rather than rediscovering it after a Docker rebuild.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
